a =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{1}{1}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡1 \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write the complex number $z$ in polar form:\n\n$$\nz=\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}))\n$$" 13194139534140 true] [17592186278433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278434 13194139534140 true] [17592186278433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278435 13194139534140 true] [17592186278433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278436 13194139534140 true] [17592186278433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278437 13194139534140 true] [17592186278433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278438 13194139534140 true] [17592186278433 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534140 true] [17592186278433 1041 "selection" 13194139534140 true] [17592186278433 1104 #edb/ref 17592186278436 13194139534140 true] [17592186278433 1110 #uuid "09d9464c-98e9-5d2d-964c-3d811c212b40" 13194139534140 true] [17592186278434 1034 "z=\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}))" 13194139534140 true] [17592186278434 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534140 true] [17592186278434 1111 #uuid "56ee7ebe-98fd-5a33-bee4-535eeb797b9c" 13194139534140 true] [17592186278435 1034 "z=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})" 13194139534140 true] [17592186278435 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534140 true] [17592186278435 1111 #uuid "e56afc50-f55b-59a0-8b5c-f99d8ff7ade3" 13194139534140 true] [17592186278436 1034 "z=\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}))" 13194139534140 true] [17592186278436 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534140 true] [17592186278436 1111 #uuid "da2ef5f6-f7af-550f-94f1-33b120c84acf" 13194139534140 true] [17592186278437 1034 "z=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})" 13194139534140 t